# Curi UX

Follow `docs/UX-PRINCIPLES.md` and `docs/FLOWS.md`.

- One primary action per screen; Today shows all paths (due vs done today).
- Auth after value; sources visible; streak supportive not punitive.
- Brand: white-first, vermilion `#C1121F`, Fraunces + Plus Jakarta Sans.
- No gamification, fake urgency, or signup walls before lesson 1.

Before merge: run mental-model check — would a first-time founder predict this screen correctly?
